gal case against him."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Laura Munar, profesora de literatura en un instituto de Palma de Mallorca y recién separada de Iván, su novio de toda la vida, queda una noche a cenar con Xavier Vera, reputado cirujano en la isla y padre de uno de sus alumnos. A la mañana siguiente, Laura amanece sola en su cama con náuseas y un gran vacío en su memoria. Lo que empieza siendo un malestar físico se convierte pronto en una sospecha terrible: Xavier la ha drogado y violado. Con la ayuda de su hermana Cata, que trabaja de anestesista en el mismo hospital que Xavier, Laura acude a la policía para denunciar a Vera por violación","tagline":"Dos lados. Una verdad."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t90DulIUeeE8gpGnHeyVlvCOcaX.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g8L6Z9UuHxt4uIuyMJfOgn0yWye.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2020,"episodeCount":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tNYLXZWbOtBL3TZsyyFqJluN225.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102192/season/1"}],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":102192,"type":"tv","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t90DulIUeeE8gpGnHeyVlvCOcaX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t90DulIUeeE8gpGnHeyVlvCOcaX.jpg","language":"it","width":680,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t90DulIUeeE8gpGnHeyVlvCOcaX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t90DulIUeeE8gpGnHeyVlvCOcaX.jpg","language":"it","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eE5bWJqstJtjkY2VtoBaSH7w3Kw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eE5bWJqstJtjkY2VtoBaSH7w3Kw.jpg","language":"it","wid